{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Will you create a lasting civilization or see it collapse into the sea?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Sea, Sun &amp; Salt, you build a city on a small mediterranean island. Define the tenets of your culture, deal with your subjects' needs and withstand the forces of the elements.</p><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617200/extras/4c2816befa4a0bdcf8a82e7958ce1465.poster.avif?t=1759510649\" width=800 height=208 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617200/extras/4c2816befa4a0bdcf8a82e7958ce1465.webm?t=1759510649\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617200/extras/4c2816befa4a0bdcf8a82e7958ce1465.mp4?t=1759510649\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build</h2>Progress through the game and build a magnificent city. The further you go, the more complex your city's needs will get.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617200/extras/1616c8f3016fce6be73d22a64ec182c5.poster.avif?t=1759510649\" width=800 height=208 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617200/extras/1616c8f3016fce6be73d22a64ec182c5.webm?t=1759510649\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617200/extras/1616c8f3016fce6be73d22a64ec182c5.mp4?t=1759510649\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Survive</h2>If you fail your subjects, your city will not last long. Water recedes when times are good but when things go wrong, beware of the rising tide.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617200/extras/7a3a7cdcaa10a2c4fc6ea49e7802e4fc.poster.avif?t=1759510649\" width=800 height=208 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617200/extras/7a3a7cdcaa10a2c4fc6ea49e7802e4fc.webm?t=1759510649\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617200/extras/7a3a7cdcaa10a2c4fc6ea49e7802e4fc.mp4?t=1759510649\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Decide</h2>As your city's population grows, your subjects will look up to you for answers. How was the world created? What do they worship? When's the best time to bathe? Make these choices, and more, to direct your people.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617200/extras/56bf004185a766bb3075df8f12232e57.poster.avif?t=1759510649\" width=800 height=228 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617200/extras/56bf004185a766bb3075df8f12232e57.webm?t=1759510649\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617200/extras/56bf004185a766bb3075df8f12232e57.mp4?t=1759510649\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Also features:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A gentle difficulty progression fit for all player types<br></li><li>Over 100 unique buildings<br></li><li>A progression system with over 15 eras<br></li><li>Complete runs of more than 10 hours<br></li><li>30 achievements that introduce new challenges for the more hard-core players<br></li><li>A relaxing sound track by William King<br></li><li>And many secrets hidden in the depth</li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3617200?t=1759510649","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3617200?t=1759510649","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617200/aa1cfe715aae41c824c3e0bcc9132106bd7cce90/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759510649","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617200/aa1cfe715aae41c824c3e0bcc9132106bd7cce90/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759510649","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4005760,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Will you create a lasting civilization or see it collapse into the sea?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Sea, Sun &amp; Salt, you build a city on a small mediterranean island. Define the tenets of your culture, deal with your subjects' needs and withstand the forces of the elements.</p><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617200/extras/4c2816befa4a0bdcf8a82e7958ce1465.poster.avif?t=1759510649\" width=800 height=208 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617200/extras/4c2816befa4a0bdcf8a82e7958ce1465.webm?t=1759510649\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617200/extras/4c2816befa4a0bdcf8a82e7958ce1465.mp4?t=1759510649\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build</h2>Progress through the game and build a magnificent city. The further you go, the more complex your city's needs will get.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617200/extras/1616c8f3016fce6be73d22a64ec182c5.poster.avi