85a766bb3075df8f12232e57.mp4?t=1759510649\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Also features:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A gentle difficulty progression fit for all player types<br></li><li>Over 100 unique buildings<br></li><li>A progression system with over 15 eras<br></li><li>Complete runs of more than 10 hours<br></li><li>30 achievements that introduce new challenges for the more hard-core players<br></li><li>A relaxing sound track by William King<br></li><li>And many secrets hidden in the depth</li></ul>","developers":["Emerick Gibson"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617200/5325f64b3766d60d1f6dee02976f3b581c96d67a/header.jpg?t=1759510649","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3617200/1158416447/7bcedc19620ebbca8585b5c165292db5e8921ed7/1759474716/dash_av1.mpd?t=1759475145","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3617200/1158416447/7bcedc19620ebbca8585b5c165292db5e8921ed7/1759474716/dash_h264.mpd?t=1759475145","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3617200/1158416447/7bcedc19620ebbca8585b5c165292db5e8921ed7/1759474716/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1759475145","id":257211185,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257211185/movie480.mp4?t=1759475145","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257211185/movie_max.mp4?t=1759475145"},"name":"New Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257211185/7d04ea98d35508